#MOBILE
Vnum       16000
Keywords   master yoda grand jedi~
Short      Grand Master Yoda~
Long       Grand Master Yoda moves slowly through the corridor, deep in thought.
~
Desc       Ancient beyond reckoning, Grand Master Yoda carries nine hundred years of
wisdom in his small green frame. His large eyes miss nothing and his
presence in the Force is immense, like a great calm at the centre of
a storm. He regards you with gentle but penetrating attention.
~
