Short      Master Obi-Wan Kenobi~
Long       Master Obi-Wan Kenobi stands here, his expression calm and measured.
~
Desc       One of the most celebrated Jedi Masters of his generation, Obi-Wan
Kenobi carries himself with a quiet confidence born of long experience.
His robes are travel-worn and his eyes carry the weight of great loss
balanced by unshakeable faith in the Force. He is always willing to
offer guidance to those who seek it sincerely.
~
