Vnum       16002
Keywords   master mace windu jedi~
Short      Master Mace Windu~
Long       Master Mace Windu stands here, arms folded, watching with sharp eyes.
~
Desc       Master of the rare Vaapad form of lightsaber combat, Mace Windu
radiates a barely contained intensity. His shaved head and stern
expression project absolute authority, yet his counsel is always
precise and considered. He studies you with the directness of one
accustomed to seeing through deception.
~
