#MOBILE
Vnum       16003
Keywords   master qui-gon jinn jedi~
Short      Master Qui-Gon Jinn~
Long       Master Qui-Gon Jinn meditates quietly here, at peace with the living Force.
~
Desc       Unconventional even by Jedi standards, Qui-Gon Jinn follows the
living Force with a devotion that sometimes puts him at odds with
the Council. His long hair and calm bearing give him the appearance
of a wandering philosopher rather than one of the most capable
swordsmen in the Order. He opens his eyes and greets you warmly.
~
Race       Human~
Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
