#MOBILE
Vnum       16004
Keywords   master ahsoka tano jedi~
Short      Ahsoka Tano~
Long       Ahsoka Tano moves with effortless precision, her white lightsabers at her belt.
~
Desc       No longer formally a Jedi, Ahsoka Tano carries the weight of that
distinction with quiet dignity. Her twin white lightsabers and her
Togruta markings are immediately recognisable to anyone versed in
recent history. She moves with the fluid economy of an extraordinarily
skilled fighter and meets your gaze with direct, honest eyes.
~
