Long       Jedi Archivist Jocasta Nu moves carefully between the archive shelves.
~
Desc       Chief Librarian of the Jedi Archives, Jocasta Nu carries herself with
the quiet authority of one who controls access to the most extensive
collection of knowledge in the galaxy. Her silver hair is impeccably
arranged and her robes are those of a senior Master. She peers at
you over her spectacles with the particular look of a librarian
assessing whether you will be trouble.
~
