#MOBILE
Vnum       16009
Keywords   master plo koon jedi kel dor~
Short      Master Plo Koon~
Long       Master Plo Koon stands here, his masked face unreadable but his presence warm.
~
Desc       A Kel Dor Jedi Master of exceptional ability, Plo Koon is known
throughout the Order for combining formidable combat skill with a
genuine warmth that is unusual among the senior Council members.
His distinctive anti-ox mask and goggles cover a face that
nevertheless manages to project kindness. He is particularly
devoted to the Padawans and Younglings of the Temple and they
respond to him with open affection. He greets you with a slight
incline of his head and an air of patient attention.
~
Race       Human~
Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     male~
Actflags   npc sentinel practice~
