Affect         -1 -1 5 3 0
#EXDESC
ExDescKey  holocron jedi blue~
ExDesc     A pyramidal Jedi holocron, its surface warm to the touch and softly
glowing blue. When held, faint voices can be heard — ancient Jedi
Masters imparting fragments of wisdom and technique. The knowledge
within is immense and patient, available to those who approach it
with sincerity.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

#OBJECT
Vnum       16001
Keywords   lightsaber jedi blue blade~
Type       weapon~
Short      a Jedi lightsaber~
Long       A Jedi lightsaber lies here, its casing polished and engraved.~
Flags      magic glow~
WFlags     take wield~
Values     5 30 60 3 0 5000
Stats      8 15000 1500 0 0
Affect         -1 -1 12 13 0
Affect         -1 -1 12 14 0
#EXDESC
ExDescKey  lightsaber jedi blade~
ExDesc     A Jedi lightsaber with a blade of pure blue light. The hilt is
engraved with Jedi script reading "Peace through understanding,
strength through serenity." It hums with a clarity that feels
entirely unlike the corrupted weapons of the Sith.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

#OBJECT
Vnum       16002
