#EXDESC
ExDescKey  robes jedi temple brown~
ExDesc     The simple tan and brown robes of a Jedi Temple initiate. Woven
from durable natural fibres and reinforced with subtle Force-imbued
threading, they offer surprising protection while maintaining the
Jedi philosophy of simplicity and non-attachment to material things.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

