#EXDESC
ExDescKey  belt jedi utility~
ExDesc     The standard-issue Jedi utility belt, its various pouches
containing medpacs, a comlink, spare power cells, and other
essentials. The belt itself is reinforced and carries a subtle
Force-imbued blessing that seems to make its wearer more resilient.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

#OBJECT
Vnum       16004
