Affect         -1 -1 4 4 0
#EXDESC
ExDescKey  manuscript tome jedi ancient~
ExDesc     An illuminated manuscript from the earliest days of the Jedi Order,
its pages covered in the flowing script of the ancient Je'daii. The
text covers the nature of the Force in a depth that is humbling.
Reading it expands something in the mind that is difficult to name
but impossible to ignore.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

