#EXDESC
ExDescKey  remote training sphere~
ExDesc     A spherical training remote in its deactivated state. Its surface
is covered in small scorch marks from thousands of training sessions.
The central photoreceptor is dark but seems somehow still watchful.
Carrying it is said to sharpen Force-reflexes even when inactive.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

#OBJECT
