#EXDESC
ExDescKey  crystal kyber ilum blue~
ExDesc     A raw kyber crystal harvested from the caverns of Ilum during the
traditional Jedi pilgrimage. The crystal is cold to the touch and
hums with a resonance audible only to Force-sensitives. It pulses
in response to strong emotions, brightening with calm and dimming
with agitation. It is the heart of a lightsaber waiting to be built,
and carrying it creates a sense of quiet attentiveness.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

