#EXDESC
ExDescKey  sash jedi ceremonial master~
ExDesc     The ceremonial sash worn by Jedi Masters at formal occasions and
Council sessions. This one is woven from a rare fabric that holds
Force impressions — the accumulated calm of many years of meditation
by its previous owner is still present in the weave. Wearing it
imparts a subtle steadiness of mind and purpose.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

#OBJECT
Vnum       16008
Keywords   focus lens lightsaber adegan~
Short      an Adegan focusing lens~
Long       A precision Adegan focusing lens for a lightsaber rests here in a cushioned case.~
