#EXDESC
ExDescKey  lens adegan lightsaber focus~
ExDesc     A precision-ground Adegan crystal focusing lens used in advanced
lightsaber construction. The quality of the lens determines the
tightness and stability of the blade. This one is of exceptional
quality, ground by a master craftsman over months of careful work.
Even outside a lightsaber hilt it focuses ambient Force energy in
a way that sharpens the concentration of anyone carrying it.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

