#EXDESC
ExDescKey  pendant force vergence jedi~
ExDesc     A pendant containing a small chip of stone taken from the floor of
a Force vergence — a location where the living Force converges with
unusual intensity. The stone retains a fraction of that convergence.
Wearing it enhances perception and clarity significantly and
creates a persistent sense of being slightly more awake than usual.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

#OBJECT
