#EXDESC
ExDescKey  staff parablade jedi training~
ExDesc     A training weapon used by Jedi who study the Niman or Jar'Kai forms —
a staff with low-intensity parablade emitters at each end producing
short blades that sting without injuring. Used for training it
builds ambidextrous technique and spatial awareness simultaneously.
Many Jedi who never use a staff in the field swear by staff training
for the skills it develops.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

