#EXDESC
ExDescKey  boots jedi temple worn~
ExDesc     The standard issue boots of the Jedi Order, worn to the comfortable
softness that comes from years of use across a hundred different
terrains. Force-imbued threading in the soles provides subtle
stability and lightness of step. These particular boots have
walked the corridors of the Temple for years and carry the
accumulated ease of a practitioner fully at home in their body.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

#OBJECT
Vnum       16012
