#EXDESC
ExDescKey  cloak jedi grey traveling~
ExDesc     The outer cloak worn by Jedi in the field — grey-brown, hooded,
and woven from a material that provides warmth in cold and
breathability in heat. The cut obscures the lightsaber at the
belt without impeding access to it. Generations of Jedi have
disappeared into crowds in this cloak, which is more or less
the point. The hood smells faintly of Tatooine sand and
Coruscant rain in equal measure.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

