ExDesc     Bracers worn during combat training to channel Force energy through
the forearms and improve precision of movement. The wrist joints
are reinforced with a flexible composite that supports without
restricting. Wearing them during training accelerates the development
of the fine motor control that advanced lightsaber technique requires.
~
#ENDEXDESC
