#ROOM
Vnum     16008
Name     The Eastern Meditation Terrace~
Sector   field~
Flags    ~
Desc     An open terrace on the eastern side of the Temple grounds, elevated
slightly above the garden below. Stone railings enclose the space
and potted plants from Ilum, Dagobah, and Felucia grow in large urns.
Several Jedi sit in deep meditation here. The Force feels particularly
accessible in this place, as though the years of practice have worn
grooves in the fabric of reality itself. The garden is below to the south.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    16003
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    16017
#ENDEXIT

