#ROOM
Vnum     16099
Name     The Temple — The Final Arch~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     The last room before the Temple's deepest meditation level — a vaulted
arch of ancient stone through which every Jedi who has ever served
has passed. The stone is worn smooth at shoulder height on both sides,
where generations of hands have touched it in passing. The arch leads
nowhere else remarkable. It is the journey through it that matters.
Beyond lies the Force Nexus meditation space beneath the Temple.
The inner courtyard is accessible to the north.
~
